 and the modification notice above still apply. All one-shot PCM remains exact.
 Runtime loops supply one cyclic interpolation frame beyond the loop endpoint
 to prevent fractional-pitch interpolation into resource silence padding.
+
+Directional collision revision 1, 2026-10-10: scrape.wav blends the existing
+audible-edge (Tom Haigh)/qubodup tire squeal (CC BY 3.0) with dense offline
+transposed stone/metal grains from KALeigh0218 and granular driving from cognito
+perceptu (both CC0). Filtering, envelope control, cyclic crossfade, loudness
+mastering and dither produce a sustained barrier screech. The tire attribution
+and modification notice above also apply to scrape.wav and previews using it.
+impact_0/1/2.wav revoice the same qubodup CC0 collision with deeper Nox CC0 body
+movement and longer medium/heavy settling tails, retaining immediate attacks.
+These are designed fictional vehicle impacts, not dedicated fence/bridge/crash
+field recordings. Source and derivative checksums remain in manifest.json.
